pages.mail=()=>`<section class="mail-scene sunshine-signup-page" id="sunday-letter"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="eyebrow">CHAOTIC SUNSHINE · A CREATIVE FAITH STUDIO</span><h1>Sunshine<br>Mail<span class="mail-sunburst" aria-hidden="true">✷</span></h1><p class="mail-promise hand">The letter you can't resist opening.</p><p class="mail-hero-intro">Faith, creativity, a little delightful chaos. Every month, a handmade-feeling illustrated note arrives with something good to read, make, remember, and try.</p><div class="mail-hero-features"><p>✷ <strong>Beautifully unexpected Bible discoveries</strong></p><p>✷ <strong>Creative experiments for ordinary days</strong></p><p>✷ <strong>Real-life faith, side quests &amp; encouragement</strong></p></div><p class="mail-handnote hand">Pew not required. Curiosity very welcome.</p></div><div class="mail-signup-box"><div class="mail-envelope"><button type="button" class="mail-envelope-trigger" id="mail-open-envelope" aria-label="Pop open the illustrated sample Sunshine Mail letter"><span class="mail-pocket" aria-hidden="true">${art('sunshine-envelope-shell-v1.webp','')}<span class="mail-pocket-letter">${art('welcome-letter-v3.webp','')}</span><img class="mail-pocket-front" src="assets/sunshine-envelope-shell-v1.webp" alt=""></span></button><span class="mail-pocket-caption hand">Go on. Peek inside.</span></div><form class="letter-form" id="sunshine-signup" action="https://app.kit.com/forms/10182939/subscriptions" method="post" aria-label="Join Sunshine Mail"><h2>Sunshine in your inbox.</h2><p>One illustrated letter a month with Scripture, an honest reflection, and something creative to try.</p><label for="signup-name">What should I call you? <small>A nickname works.</small></label><input id="signup-name" type="text" name="fields[first_name]" autocomplete="given-name" maxlength="60" required><label for="signup-email">Email address</label><input id="signup-email" type="email" name="email_address" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" placeholder="Enter your primary email" required><div class="signup-honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="signup-website">Leave this empty</label><input id="signup-website" name="cs_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><button type="submit">Let me in on the good mail</button><p class="signup-reassurance">Free to join. Monthly, with occasional extras. Unsubscribe anytime.</p><small>We use Kit to deliver Sunshine Mail. After signup, follow the confirmation instructions to finish joining. <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></small><p id="signup-status" class="notice" role="status"></p></form><aside class="sunshine-letter-peek" aria-label="Open a real sample of Sunshine Mail"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE PEEK INSIDE THE ENVELOPE</span><a class="sunshine-letter-art" href="welcome.html" aria-label="Read the complete illustrated sample Sunshine Mail letter">${art('welcome-letter-v3.webp','Original illustrated Sunshine Mail welcome letter in jewel tones')}</a><p class="hand">A real letter, not another inbox chore.</p><button class="button secondary" type="button" id="mail-open-sample">Let me peek inside</button><p class="quiet">Peek inside freely. No subscription required.</p></aside><dialog class="mail-letter-popup" id="mail-letter-popup" aria-labelledby="mail-letter-popup-title"><div class="mail-popup-controls"><span class="eyebrow">SUNSHINE MAIL · AN ILLUSTRATED SAMPLE</span><button type="button" id="mail-close-popup" aria-label="Close the letter">Close ✕</button></div><h2 id="mail-letter-popup-title">A little sunshine for you.</h2><p>The letter you can open before you subscribe.</p><img src="assets/welcome-letter-v3.webp" alt="Original illustrated watercolor Sunshine Mail welcome letter; full readable text available on the sample letter page." width="1122" height="1402" loading="lazy"><div class="mail-popup-actions"><a class="button" href="welcome.html">Read the complete letter in clear text →</a><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="mail-close-popup-bottom">Back to Sunshine Mail</button></div></dialog></div><div class="mail-benefits-panel"><h2 class="mail-benefits-heading">A little biblical depth. A little creative mischief.</h2><ul class="mail-benefits"><li><strong>Thoughtful devotions</strong> for the beautifully messy days we actually have.</li><li><strong>Bible lessons and good questions</strong> to help you understand Scripture and live it out.</li><li><strong>Creative prompts</strong> for sketching, journaling, making, and noticing something new.</li><li><strong>Little adventures and Side Quests</strong> to put faith, curiosity, and kindness into motion.</li></ul><p>Each monthly edition brings a fresh mix of faith, creativity, and encouragement from Amy, with occasional extras along the way.</p>${go('welcome','Open a sample Sunshine Mail letter ↗','text-link')}<p class="quiet">The free library is yours to explore whether or not you subscribe.</p></div></div></section>`;
